# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not, so it must never
# hold a real key.
#
# One script reads this, `benchmarks/nl_eval.py`, and it is the only part of the project
# that calls out. The 700-odd tests, the solver, the service and the demo all run with no
# key at all — `roster_replan/nl.py` takes an injected client precisely so that stays true.
#
# A real shell environment variable wins over anything set here.

# https://platform.claude.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to the model `nl.MODEL` ships, which is what the eval should be
# reported against; override only to shake out plumbing more cheaply.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
